  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Finally, General Kale made contact. She escaped Earth with a fleet of her best soldiers, and they've taken refuge in a space station not far from Mars. From there, they're planning and strategising what to do about the giant damn monster that's eating our planet.",
    "value": "终于，凯尔将军联系我们了。她带着一支精锐部队逃离了地球，目前在离火星不远的一个空间站里避难。他们正在那里筹划，要如何对付那只正在吞噬我们星球的巨型怪物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "I overheard all this as my superior officer spoke to her on the comm-link. He asked her what she suggested the rest of humanity do. 'Do whatever,' she said. 'It's going to be a long road home'. I don't think we're going back to Earth any time soon.",
    "value": "我的上司通过通讯链路和她通话时，我听到了这一切。他问她，对剩下的人类有什么建议。“随便做点什么吧，”她说，“这将是一条漫长的归家之路。”我觉得，我们短期内是回不去地球了。"
  }
]